concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bb a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41BB Administrative processes (Parts 4-4 to 4-10)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41bb ;
    values:originalText "The administrative processes under this Chapter are: (a) issuing conformity assessment certificates for some manufacturers of medical devices; and (aa) making conformity assessment body determinations; and (b) including medical devices in the Register; and  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "The administrative processes under this Chapter are: (a) issuing conformity assessment certificates for some manufacturers of medical devices; and (aa) making conformity assessment body determinations; and (b) including medical devices in the Register; and  Chapter 4  Medical devices"@en ;
