concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bh a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41BH Meaning of compliance with essential principles"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41bh ;
    values:originalText "(1) A medical device complies, for the purposes of this Chapter (including Part 4-11), with the essential principles if and only if it does not contravene any of the essential principles. (2) However, a medical device is also taken, for the purposes of this Chapter (other than Part 4-11), to comply with the essential principles if: (a) the medical device complies with one or more medical device standards that apply to it; and (b) the medical device contravenes the essential principles only in respect of a part or parts of the essential principles to which that medical device standard, or one or more of those medical device standards, relate.  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A medical device complies, for the purposes of this Chapter (including Part 4-11), with the essential principles if and only if it does not contravene any of the essential principles. (2) However, a medical device is also taken, for the purposes of this Chapter (other than Part 4-11), to comply with the essential principles if: (a) the medical device complies with one or more medical device standards that apply to it; and (b) the medical device contravenes the essential principles only in respect of a part or parts of the essential principles to which that medical device standard, or one or more of those medical device standards, relate.  Chapter 4  Medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0171298716f5bdc5e9b2307f0e07b794dba72a411869e5bf26fa87ba2a8b9704" ;
    cof:pageNumber "27"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bh-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bh-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.27" .
