concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bh-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41BH(2) Meaning of compliance with essential principles"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41bh-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) However, a medical device is also taken, for the purposes of this Chapter (other than Part 4-11), to comply with the essential principles if: (a) the medical device complies with one or more medical device standards that apply to it; and (b) the medical device contravenes the essential principles only in respect of a part or parts of the essential principles to which that medical device standard, or one or more of those medical device standards, relate.  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(2) However, a medical device is also taken, for the purposes of this Chapter (other than Part 4-11), to comply with the essential principles if: (a) the medical device complies with one or more medical device standards that apply to it; and (b) the medical device contravenes the essential principles only in respect of a part or parts of the essential principles to which that medical device standard, or one or more of those medical device standards, relate.  Chapter 4  Medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7ed323b589b283d900b869a93c9759043e6aeea3b057cbdd9992f4dfa60da8b3" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bh ;
    cof:pageNumber "27"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Compliance with medical device standards is sufficient for compliance with essential principles." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.27" ;
    cml:asserts concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bh-ss-2-norm .
