    values:originalText "(1) A conformity assessment procedure is taken, for the purposes of this Chapter, not to have been applied to a medical device if: (a) there has been a contravention of the conformity assessment procedures; and (b) the contravention relates, wholly or partly, to that device or its manufacture." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A conformity assessment procedure is taken, for the purposes of this Chapter, not to have been applied to a medical device if: (a) there has been a contravention of the conformity assessment procedures; and (b) the contravention relates, wholly or partly, to that device or its manufacture."@en ;
