doc:sec-41bi-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "41BI(1) Meaning of non-application of conformity assessment" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A requirement that is comparable to a conformity assessment procedure is taken, for the purposes of this Chapter, not to have been applied to a medical device by the manufacturer of the device if: (a) there has been a contravention of the requirement; and (b) the contravention relates, wholly or partly, to that device or its manufacture.  Medical devices  Chapter 4 Introduction  Part 4-1 Interpretation  Division 2 Section 41BIB Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025" ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bi-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41BI(2) Meaning of non-application of conformity assessment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41bi-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) However, for the purposes of this Chapter (other than Part 4-11), subsection (1) does not apply if: (a) the quality management system applied in the manufacture of the medical device complies with one or more conformity assessment standards that apply to it; and (b) the contravention is only in respect of a part or parts of the requirement to which that conformity assessment standard, or one or more of those conformity assessment standards, relate. 41BIB  Overseas regulators" ;
    skos:definition "(2) However, for the purposes of this Chapter (other than Part 4-11), subsection (1) does not apply if: (a) the quality management system applied in the manufacture of the medical device complies with one or more conformity assessment standards that apply to it; and (b) the contravention is only in respect of a part or parts of the requirement to which that conformity assessment standard, or one or more of those conformity assessment standards, relate. 41BIB  Overseas regulators"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2aa38e29c6f814ca7e871fb2caa6b3948b8b56506221cdd313191405de04a813" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bi ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Secretary may determine a body for the purposes of subsection (1). Exemptions from conformity assessment requirements" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
