doc:sec-41bi-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "41BI(2) Meaning of non-application of conformity assessment" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Secretary may, by notifiable instrument, determine a body for the purposes of subsection (1). The Secretary must be satisfied that the body: (a) is established outside Australia; and (b) is empowered to issue certificates or other documents to the effect that the body is satisfied that requirements, comparable to the conformity assessment procedures, have been applied to medical devices by the manufacturers of the devices." ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bi-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41BI(3) Meaning of non-application of conformity assessment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41bi-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Without limiting subsection (2), the Secretary may determine a body by reference to a designation, recognition, approval or authorisation (however described) of the body: (a) by one or more countries; or (b) by another body. Note: For specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act 2003.  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(3) Without limiting subsection (2), the Secretary may determine a body by reference to a designation, recognition, approval or authorisation (however described) of the body: (a) by one or more countries; or (b) by another body. Note: For specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act 2003.  Chapter 4  Medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0d9ee7fe0e166737c14ac656758a1e8315c0b2d9368bce683b141437cb3d7520" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bi ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "A conformity assessment standard only applies to specified parts of procedures. The Secretary may determine a body by reference to a designation, recognition, approval or authorization." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.28" ;
    cml:asserts concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bi-ss-3-norm .
