concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41cb-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41CB(3) Medical device standards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41cb-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, an order under subsection (1) of this section, or a variation of such an order, may make provision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating, with or without modification, any matter contained in an instrument or other writing as in force or existing from time to time." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, an order under subsection (1) of this section, or a variation of such an order, may make provision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating, with or without modification, any matter contained in an instrument or other writing as in force or existing from time to time."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4c3eed0c4aaf1d570d7b20570f4287e4f37c66899758a65d78d811c3f2b532bc" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41cb ;
    cof:pageNumber "34"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Allows for incorporation of existing instruments or writings into an order or variation thereof." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
