concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41dd a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41DD Content of conformity assessment standards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41dd ;
    values:originalText "(1) Without limiting the scope of section 41DC, an order establishing a conformity assessment standard for a kind of medical device may be specified by reference to: (a) procedures to be carried out under the quality management systems for the design, manufacture and final inspection of the devices; or (b) a standard published by a standards organisation; or  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Without limiting the scope of section 41DC, an order establishing a conformity assessment standard for a kind of medical device may be specified by reference to: (a) procedures to be carried out under the quality management systems for the design, manufacture and final inspection of the devices; or (b) a standard published by a standards organisation; or  Chapter 4  Medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c1703b55d1ca02420abfffb5cf8f3460e9e414c159b6d8d591aaca8a4001ca82" ;
    cof:pageNumber "41"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Specifies how an order establishing a conformity assessment standard for a kind of medical device may be specified." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.41" ;
    cml:asserts concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41dd-norm .
