doc:sec-41dd a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "41DD Content of conformity assessment standards" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) Without limiting the scope of section 41DC, an order establishing a conformity assessment standard for a kind of medical device may be specified by reference to: (a) procedures to be carried out under the quality management systems for the design, manufacture and final inspection of the devices; or (b) a standard published by a standards organisation; or  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
    cof:pageNumber "41"^^xsd:integer .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41de a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41DE Inconsistencies between conformity assessment standards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41de ;
    values:originalText "A conformity assessment standard that: (a) identifies quality management systems to which it applies; and (b) is inconsistent with another conformity assessment standard that applies only to particular kinds of medical devices; is, to the extent of the inconsistency, of no effect in relation to the devices referred to in paragraph (b).  Medical devices  Chapter 4 Conformity assessment certificates  Part 4-4  Section 41E Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025" ;
    skos:definition "A conformity assessment standard that: (a) identifies quality management systems to which it applies; and (b) is inconsistent with another conformity assessment standard that applies only to particular kinds of medical devices; is, to the extent of the inconsistency, of no effect in relation to the devices referred to in paragraph (b).  Medical devices  Chapter 4 Conformity assessment certificates  Part 4-4  Section 41E Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "20dc965ccfe51ffcf7503baf65b1bc6a34539833a496d0f97f6a6d07bad08194" ;
    cof:pageNumber "42"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Inconsistencies between conformity assessment standards are of no effect." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.42" ;
    cml:asserts concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41de-norm .
