lty for making a false statement A person contravenes this section if: (a) the person makes a statement (whether orally, in a document or in any other way); and (b) the statement is false or misleading in a material particular; and (c) the statement is in or in connection with an application for a conformity assessment certificate. Maximum civil penalty: (a) for an individual—5,000 penalty units; and (b) for a body corporate—50,000 penalty units.  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
