    cof:title "41EJ(4) Automatic conditions on conformity assessment certificates" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) A conformity assessment certificate is subject to the condition that the applicant for the certificate will pay a fee, prescribed in the regulations, for a review under subsection (2), when the fee becomes due and payable." ;
    cof:pageNumber "54"^^xsd:integer .

