concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ek a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41EK Conditions imposed when conformity assessment certificates"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41ek ;
    values:originalText "are issued If the Secretary issues a conformity assessment certificate in respect of a manufacturer, the Secretary may, in writing, impose conditions on the certificate in respect of: (a) one or more kinds of medical devices covered by the certificate; or (b) the manufacturer’s quality management system." ;
    skos:definition "are issued If the Secretary issues a conformity assessment certificate in respect of a manufacturer, the Secretary may, in writing, impose conditions on the certificate in respect of: (a) one or more kinds of medical devices covered by the certificate; or (b) the manufacturer’s quality management system."@en ;
