doc:sec-41el-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "41EL(3) Conditions imposed after issuing a conformity assessment" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of paragraphs (2)(aa) and (ab), the earlier day must not be earlier than the day the notice is given to the person.  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
    cof:pageNumber "56"^^xsd:integer .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41em a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41EM Suspension of conformity assessment certificates"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41em ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Secretary may, by written notice given to the person in relation to whom a conformity assessment certificate is issued, suspend the certificate if the Secretary is satisfied that it is likely that there are grounds for revoking the certificate under section 41ET. (2) The suspension may be limited to some medical devices of that kind, as specified in the notice. (3) The notice must specify the period of the suspension. The period must not exceed 6 months. Note: The period of the suspension may be extended under section 41EO." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Secretary may, by written notice given to the person in relation to whom a conformity assessment certificate is issued, suspend the certificate if the Secretary is satisfied that it is likely that there are grounds for revoking the certificate under section 41ET. (2) The suspension may be limited to some medical devices of that kind, as specified in the notice. (3) The notice must specify the period of the suspension. The period must not exceed 6 months. Note: The period of the suspension may be extended under section 41EO."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "791ed762b50a8c0fb3e3614d252d8b76e74f6b12ef56455175358fd6e5858d3b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "58"^^xsd:integer ;
