concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ep a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41EP Revocation of suspension"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41ep ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Secretary must revoke the suspension if the Secretary is satisfied that: (a) the ground on which the conformity assessment certificate was suspended no longer applies; and (b) there are no other grounds for suspending the certificate. (2) The Secretary’s power to revoke the suspension may be exercised:  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Secretary must revoke the suspension if the Secretary is satisfied that: (a) the ground on which the conformity assessment certificate was suspended no longer applies; and (b) there are no other grounds for suspending the certificate. (2) The Secretary’s power to revoke the suspension may be exercised:  Chapter 4  Medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c14b17c16df9f5a641036717f24e00fb166071772851529b63c0500adfd545cd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "59"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ep-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ep-ss-2 ;
