concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ev a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41EV Publication of revocation etc. of conformity assessment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41ev ;
    values:originalText "certificates The Secretary must cause to be published in the Gazette or on the Department’s website, as soon as practicable after revoking a conformity assessment certificate, or varying a conformity assessment certificate under subsection 41EU(2), a notice setting out particulars of the revocation or variation.  Medical devices  Chapter 4 Conformity assessment certificates  Part 4-4 Revocation of conformity assessment certificates  Division 4 Section 41EW Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025" ;
    skos:definition "certificates The Secretary must cause to be published in the Gazette or on the Department’s website, as soon as practicable after revoking a conformity assessment certificate, or varying a conformity assessment certificate under subsection 41EU(2), a notice setting out particulars of the revocation or variation.  Medical devices  Chapter 4 Conformity assessment certificates  Part 4-4 Revocation of conformity assessment certificates  Division 4 Section 41EW Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a9e85fa95e8e0d4c8a85e0d8d9c06c1303004da65061cfec80492023c9083d24" ;
    cof:pageNumber "64"^^xsd:integer ;
