doc:sec-41ev a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "41EV Publication of revocation etc. of conformity assessment" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "certificates The Secretary must cause to be published in the Gazette or on the Department’s website, as soon as practicable after revoking a conformity assessment certificate, or varying a conformity assessment certificate under subsection 41EU(2), a notice setting out particulars of the revocation or variation.  Medical devices  Chapter 4 Conformity assessment certificates  Part 4-4 Revocation of conformity assessment certificates  Division 4 Section 41EW Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025" ;
    cof:pageNumber "64"^^xsd:integer .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ew a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41EW Date of effect of revocation etc. of conformity assessment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41ew ;
    values:originalText "certificates If the Secretary revokes a conformity assessment certificate, or varies a conformity assessment certificate under subsection 41EU(2), the revocation or variation has effect: (a) if the revocation is under section 41ER or 41ES, or the variation relates to a ground of revocation in section 41ER or 41ES—on the day on which the notice of revocation or variation is given to the person in relation to whom the certificate was issued; or (b) in any other case—on such later day as is specified in the notice.  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "certificates If the Secretary revokes a conformity assessment certificate, or varies a conformity assessment certificate under subsection 41EU(2), the revocation or variation has effect: (a) if the revocation is under section 41ER or 41ES, or the variation relates to a ground of revocation in section 41ER or 41ES—on the day on which the notice of revocation or variation is given to the person in relation to whom the certificate was issued; or (b) in any other case—on such later day as is specified in the notice.  Chapter 4  Medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5af45a80c2bae6b70c6569e91b434873a690d63e59bf4b21f5f0caae7c906dff" ;
    cof:pageNumber "65"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Date of effect for revocation or variation of conformity assessment certificate" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.65" ;
