(c) the statement is in or in connection with: (i) an application for including a kind of medical device in the Register under this Chapter; or (ii) a certification or purported certification under section 41FD. Penalty: 100 penalty units. (6) An offence against subsection (5) is an offence of strict liability.  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
