concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fh a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41FH Selecting applications for auditing"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41fh ;
    values:originalText "(1A) This section applies to applications that have passed preliminary assessment. (1) The Secretary: (a) must select for auditing any application for a kind of medical device to be included in the Register that is an application of the kind prescribed by the regulations; and (b) may select for auditing any other application for a kind of medical device to be included in the Register. Note: An application audit assessment fee is payable in respect of any application that the Secretary must select for auditing: see Part 4-10. (2) If an application is selected for auditing: (a) the Secretary must give the applicant a written notice (the selection notice) that: (i) informs the applicant of the selection; and  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(1A) This section applies to applications that have passed preliminary assessment. (1) The Secretary: (a) must select for auditing any application for a kind of medical device to be included in the Register that is an application of the kind prescribed by the regulations; and (b) may select for auditing any other application for a kind of medical device to be included in the Register. Note: An application audit assessment fee is payable in respect of any application that the Secretary must select for auditing: see Part 4-10. (2) If an application is selected for auditing: (a) the Secretary must give the applicant a written notice (the selection notice) that: (i) informs the applicant of the selection; and  Chapter 4  Medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "66457122c5f630cf409ba72872c27541259e1e4820b24b39c55633f62b256101" ;
    cof:pageNumber "81"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fh-ss-1a ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fh-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fh-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.81" .
