concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fk-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41FK(3) Lapsing of applications"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41fk-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The regulations may make provision for and in relation to the following matters: (a) applications for medical devices (priority applicant) determinations; (b) the approval by the Secretary of a form for such an application; (c) information that must accompany such an application; (d) the application fee for such an application; (e) empowering the Secretary to give the applicant a written notice requiring the applicant to give to the Secretary specified information or documents in connection with the application within a specified period (which must be at least 10 working days after the notice is given to the applicant)." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The regulations may make provision for and in relation to the following matters: (a) applications for medical devices (priority applicant) determinations; (b) the approval by the Secretary of a form for such an application; (c) information that must accompany such an application; (d) the application fee for such an application; (e) empowering the Secretary to give the applicant a written notice requiring the applicant to give to the Secretary specified information or documents in connection with the application within a specified period (which must be at least 10 working days after the notice is given to the applicant)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ddb07a3ae8346a7a4622fda2d775e880575f0b74351dd4c3c031e7280310e914" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fk ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer ;
