doc:sec-41fl a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "41FL Device number" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "If a kind of medical device is included in the Register, the Secretary is to assign a unique device number to it.  Medical devices  Chapter 4 Including medical devices in the Register  Part 4-5 Including medical devices in the Register  Division 1 Section 41FM Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025" ;
    cof:pageNumber "86"^^xsd:integer .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fm a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41FM Duration of inclusion in the Register"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41fm ;
    values:originalText "(1) The inclusion of a kind of medical device in the Register commences on the day specified for the purpose in the certificate under section 41FF or 41FJ. (2) The inclusion of a kind of medical device in the Register has effect at all times: (a) unless the kind of device is suspended from the Register under Division 1 of Part 4-6; or (b) until entry of the kind of device is cancelled from the Register under Division 2 of Part 4-6.  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The inclusion of a kind of medical device in the Register commences on the day specified for the purpose in the certificate under section 41FF or 41FJ. (2) The inclusion of a kind of medical device in the Register has effect at all times: (a) unless the kind of device is suspended from the Register under Division 1 of Part 4-6; or (b) until entry of the kind of device is cancelled from the Register under Division 2 of Part 4-6.  Chapter 4  Medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7e1a24b2e548875fa9287ae4c5b7fd82ee9f69f68eb149e65a4b89161d46642d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "87"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fm-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fm-ss-2 ;
