doc:sec-41fo-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "41FO(1) Conditions imposed when kinds of medical devices are" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the Secretary includes a kind of medical device in the Register in relation to a person, the Secretary may, in writing, impose conditions on the inclusion of the kind of device in the Register." ;
    cof:pageNumber "91"^^xsd:integer .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fo-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41FO(2) Conditions imposed when kinds of medical devices are"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41fo-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Conditions referred to in subsection (1) may relate to: (a) manufacture of devices of that kind; or (b) custody, intended purpose, supply, disposal or destruction of devices of that kind; or (c) keeping of records relating to devices of that kind, including records relating to the tracking and location of devices of that kind after their supply; or (d) matters dealt with in, or matters additional to matters dealt with in, the essential principles; or (e) such other matters relating to devices of that kind as the Secretary thinks appropriate.  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(2) Conditions referred to in subsection (1) may relate to: (a) manufacture of devices of that kind; or (b) custody, intended purpose, supply, disposal or destruction of devices of that kind; or (c) keeping of records relating to devices of that kind, including records relating to the tracking and location of devices of that kind after their supply; or (d) matters dealt with in, or matters additional to matters dealt with in, the essential principles; or (e) such other matters relating to devices of that kind as the Secretary thinks appropriate.  Chapter 4  Medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "81aa35475abe6907eba26eb5aca229efead4f92925b23b79b690aca4eaf6da67" ;
