concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gd a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41GD Revocation of suspension"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41gd ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Secretary must revoke the suspension if the Secretary is satisfied that: (a) the ground on which the kind of medical device concerned was suspended from the Register no longer applies; and (b) there are no other grounds for suspending the kind of device from the Register. (2) The Secretary’s power to revoke the suspension may be exercised:  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Secretary must revoke the suspension if the Secretary is satisfied that: (a) the ground on which the kind of medical device concerned was suspended from the Register no longer applies; and (b) there are no other grounds for suspending the kind of device from the Register. (2) The Secretary’s power to revoke the suspension may be exercised:  Chapter 4  Medical devices"@en ;
