concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gg a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41GG Duration of suspension"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41gg ;
    values:originalText "(1) A suspension under section 41GF or 41GFA takes effect on the day on which the notice is given to the person. (2) The suspension has effect until the Secretary revokes it under section 41GH." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A suspension under section 41GF or 41GFA takes effect on the day on which the notice is given to the person. (2) The suspension has effect until the Secretary revokes it under section 41GH."@en ;
