    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41gh-ss-1a ;
    values:originalText "(1A) The Secretary may revoke a suspension under section 41GFA if: (a) either: (i) the suspension referred to in paragraph 41GFA(1)(a) or (b) ends; or (ii) the person in relation to whom the kind of medical device is included in the Register provides the Secretary with another conformity assessment document that applies to the kind of device; and  Medical devices  Chapter 4 Suspension and cancellation from the Register  Part 4-6 Suspension from the Register  Division 1 Section 41GI Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (b) the Secretary is satisfied that there are no other grounds for suspending the kind of device from the Register." ;
    skos:definition "(1A) The Secretary may revoke a suspension under section 41GFA if: (a) either: (i) the suspension referred to in paragraph 41GFA(1)(a) or (b) ends; or (ii) the person in relation to whom the kind of medical device is included in the Register provides the Secretary with another conformity assessment document that applies to the kind of device; and  Medical devices  Chapter 4 Suspension and cancellation from the Register  Part 4-6 Suspension from the Register  Division 1 Section 41GI Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (b) the Secretary is satisfied that there are no other grounds for suspending the kind of device from the Register."@en ;
