doc:sec-41gh-ss-1a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "41GH(1A) Revocation of suspension" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1A) The Secretary may revoke a suspension under section 41GFA if: (a) either: (i) the suspension referred to in paragraph 41GFA(1)(a) or (b) ends; or (ii) the person in relation to whom the kind of medical device is included in the Register provides the Secretary with another conformity assessment document that applies to the kind of device; and  Medical devices  Chapter 4 Suspension and cancellation from the Register  Part 4-6 Suspension from the Register  Division 1 Section 41GI Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (b) the Secretary is satisfied that there are no other grounds for suspending the kind of device from the Register." ;
    cof:pageNumber "98"^^xsd:integer .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gh-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41GH(2) Revocation of suspension"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41gh-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) After making a revocation under subsection (1) or (1A), the Secretary must: (a) within 20 working days after the revocation, give written notice of the revocation to the person in relation to whom the kind of medical device concerned is included in the Register; and (b) as soon as practicable after the revocation, cause to be published in the Gazette or on the Department’s website a notice setting out particulars of the revocation. Subdivision C—Effect of suspension" ;
    skos:definition "(2) After making a revocation under subsection (1) or (1A), the Secretary must: (a) within 20 working days after the revocation, give written notice of the revocation to the person in relation to whom the kind of medical device concerned is included in the Register; and (b) as soon as practicable after the revocation, cause to be published in the Gazette or on the Department’s website a notice setting out particulars of the revocation. Subdivision C—Effect of suspension"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1de5133029405503c5c816c6c89c4ff30850a1843eeaaf6d8bd57b23e28dbe81" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gh ;
    cof:pageNumber "98"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Secretary must provide written notice and publish revocation notice within specified timeframe." ;
    dc:description "Notice of revocation, publication in Gazette or website" ;
