concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gy a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41GY Disposal of unused medical devices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41gy ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies to a medical device if: (a) an exemption under section 41GS in relation to that kind of medical device ceases to have effect otherwise than because that kind of medical device becomes included in the Register under Part 4-5; and (b) the medical device has not been used before the exemption so ceases to have effect. (2) The Secretary may arrange for the disposal of the medical device in accordance with the regulations. (3) Regulations made for the purposes of subsection (2) may set out the methods by which the medical device is to be stored, supplied, destroyed, exported or otherwise disposed of. (4) A method set out in the regulations under subsection (3) must not enable or permit any benefit to be conferred on a person (including the Commonwealth) other than the owner of the medical device.  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies to a medical device if: (a) an exemption under section 41GS in relation to that kind of medical device ceases to have effect otherwise than because that kind of medical device becomes included in the Register under Part 4-5; and (b) the medical device has not been used before the exemption so ceases to have effect. (2) The Secretary may arrange for the disposal of the medical device in accordance with the regulations. (3) Regulations made for the purposes of subsection (2) may set out the methods by which the medical device is to be stored, supplied, destroyed, exported or otherwise disposed of. (4) A method set out in the regulations under subsection (3) must not enable or permit any benefit to be conferred on a person (including the Commonwealth) other than the owner of the medical device.  Chapter 4  Medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "44fd65c308b3327cf3b12513f6f701cf105f61f02f3736de667f5816e9a2c60a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "113"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gy-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gy-ss-2 ;
