concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41hc-ss-6a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41HC(6A) Authorities for health practitioners"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41hc-ss-6a ;
    values:originalText "(6A) In making rules under subsection (6), the Minister must comply with: (a) such requirements (if any) as are prescribed by the regulations; and (b) such restrictions (if any) as are prescribed by the regulations; and (c) such limitations (if any) as are prescribed by the regulations." ;
