concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jd a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41JD Secretary may require information etc. about devices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41jd ;
    values:originalText "exempted under section 41HA from inclusion in the Register (1) The Secretary may give the sponsor of kinds of medical devices exempted under subsection 41HA(1) from Division 3 of Part 4-11,  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "exempted under section 41HA from inclusion in the Register (1) The Secretary may give the sponsor of kinds of medical devices exempted under subsection 41HA(1) from Division 3 of Part 4-11,  Chapter 4  Medical devices"@en ;
