doc:sec-41je-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "41JE(2) Secretary may require information relating to approvals" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Secretary may give to a person using specified kinds of medical devices, that are the subject of an approval granted to someone else under paragraph 41HB(1)(e) (use solely for experimental purposes in humans), a written notice requiring the person to give to the Secretary specified information or documents relating to either of both of the following: (a) the use of devices of those kinds; (b) any other matter prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this paragraph in relation to devices of those kinds. Compliance period" ;
    cof:pageNumber "135"^^xsd:integer .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41je-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41JE(3) Secretary may require information relating to approvals"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41je-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A notice under this section must specify a reasonable period within which the person to whom the notice is given must comply. The period must be at least 10 working days starting on the day on which the notice is given.  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(3) A notice under this section must specify a reasonable period within which the person to whom the notice is given must comply. The period must be at least 10 working days starting on the day on which the notice is given.  Chapter 4  Medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1ed799060013f2967b0bb2ec4d7920e1d03645c15f9e82c75e9ce5e7cfa3c173" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41je ;
    cof:pageNumber "135"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Secretary must specify a reasonable period for compliance with notice." ;
    dc:description "Notice period" ;
