doc:sec-41jf-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "41JF(3) Secretary may require information relating to health" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) A notice under subsection (1) or (1A) may require information to be given in accordance with specified software requirements: (a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or (b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission. 41JFA  Secretary may require information relating to approvals under section 41HD" ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jf-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41JF(1) Secretary may require information relating to health"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41jf-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Secretary may give to a person who is granted an approval under subsection 41HD(1), (1A) or (2) in relation to a medical device a written notice requiring the person to give to the Secretary specified information or documents relating to one or more of the following: (a) the supply of the medical device; (b) the handling of the medical device; (c) the monitoring of the supply of the medical device; (d) the results of the supply of the medical device; (e) any other matter prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this paragraph in relation to the kind of medical device that includes the medical device." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Secretary may give to a person who is granted an approval under subsection 41HD(1), (1A) or (2) in relation to a medical device a written notice requiring the person to give to the Secretary specified information or documents relating to one or more of the following: (a) the supply of the medical device; (b) the handling of the medical device; (c) the monitoring of the supply of the medical device; (d) the results of the supply of the medical device; (e) any other matter prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this paragraph in relation to the kind of medical device that includes the medical device."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "01b1e38840e54a81d1e77e4818208cbbad983ea495eb5d4850925280a9f86e77" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jf ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Secretary may require specified information or documents from a person granted an approval. The Secretary may require information from a person granted an authority under subsection 41HC(1)" ;
    dc:description "specified information or documents" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
