concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jg a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41JG Criminal offences for failing to give information or documents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41jg ;
    values:originalText "sought under this Division (1) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person is given a notice under section 41JCA, 41JD, 41JE, 41JF or 41JFA; and (b) the person fails to comply with the notice. Penalty: 400 penalty units. (2) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person is given a notice under section 41JCA, 41JD, 41JE, 41JF or 41JFA; and (b) the person fails to comply with the notice. Penalty: 100 penalty units. (3) An offence against subsection (2) is an offence of strict liability." ;
    skos:definition "sought under this Division (1) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person is given a notice under section 41JCA, 41JD, 41JE, 41JF or 41JFA; and (b) the person fails to comply with the notice. Penalty: 400 penalty units. (2) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person is given a notice under section 41JCA, 41JD, 41JE, 41JF or 41JFA; and (b) the person fails to comply with the notice. Penalty: 100 penalty units. (3) An offence against subsection (2) is an offence of strict liability."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "087abf06b670b386b28e788d0cd6864ef844ac51e5b8306ab616d2838b0eef0b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "138"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jg-ss-1 ;
