concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41kd a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41KD Powers of suspension and cancellation unaffected"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41kd ;
    values:originalText "Imposition of a requirement under section 41KA does not affect the Secretary’s powers to: (a) suspend the entry of a kind of medical device, or some medical devices of a particular kind, from the Register under" ;
