    skos:prefLabel "41LD Recovery of assessment fee"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41ld ;
    values:originalText "An assessment fee may be recovered by the Commonwealth as a debt due to the Commonwealth.  Medical devices  Chapter 4 Assessment fees  Part 4-10  Section 41LE Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025" ;
    skos:definition "An assessment fee may be recovered by the Commonwealth as a debt due to the Commonwealth.  Medical devices  Chapter 4 Assessment fees  Part 4-10  Section 41LE Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025"@en ;
