concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41le-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41LE(4) Reduction of conformity assessment fee where decision not"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41le-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of this section, a decision is taken to be made on the application when the applicant is notified under subsection 41EE(1) of the Secretary’s decision on the application.  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "(4) For the purposes of this section, a decision is taken to be made on the application when the applicant is notified under subsection 41EE(1) of the Secretary’s decision on the application.  Chapter 4  Medical devices"@en ;
