concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41md a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41MD Treating medical devices as prohibited imports or exports"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41md ;
    values:originalText "If: (a) the importation or exportation of a medical device is an offence under subsection 41MA(1), (4), (4A), (9), (12) or (13) or a contravention of subsection 41MAA(1) or (3); and (b) the Secretary notifies the Comptroller-General of Customs in writing that the Secretary wishes the Customs Act 1901 to apply to that importation or exportation; the Customs Act 1901 has effect as if the device included in that importation or exportation were goods described as forfeited to the Crown under section 229 of that Act because they were: (c) prohibited imports within the meaning of that Act; or  Medical devices  Chapter 4 Offences and civil penalty provisions relating to medical devices  Part 4-11 Non-compliance with essential principles  Division 1 Section 41MD Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (d) prohibited exports within the meaning of that Act; as the case requires.  Chapter 4  Medical devices" ;
    skos:definition "If: (a) the importation or exportation of a medical device is an offence under subsection 41MA(1), (4), (4A), (9), (12) or (13) or a contravention of subsection 41MAA(1) or (3); and (b) the Secretary notifies the Comptroller-General of Customs in writing that the Secretary wishes the Customs Act 1901 to apply to that importation or exportation; the Customs Act 1901 has effect as if the device included in that importation or exportation were goods described as forfeited to the Crown under section 229 of that Act because they were: (c) prohibited imports within the meaning of that Act; or  Medical devices  Chapter 4 Offences and civil penalty provisions relating to medical devices  Part 4-11 Non-compliance with essential principles  Division 1 Section 41MD Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (d) prohibited exports within the meaning of that Act; as the case requires.  Chapter 4  Medical devices"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "df7b3f7cd112cffe73791aefc7ab96ae16ca757782834a4c9386676c21d02dda" ;
    cof:pageNumber "162"^^xsd:integer ;
