concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41mg a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41MG Exceptions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41mg ;
    values:originalText "(1) Sections 41ME, 41MEA and 41MF do not apply to the extent that: (a) the quality management systems applied to the medical device comply with one or more conformity assessment standards that apply to them; and (b) the conformity assessment procedures have not been applied to the device only in respect of a part or parts of the conformity assessment procedures to which one or more of those conformity assessment standards relate. Note: Conformity assessment standards are determined under Division 2 of" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Sections 41ME, 41MEA and 41MF do not apply to the extent that: (a) the quality management systems applied to the medical device comply with one or more conformity assessment standards that apply to them; and (b) the conformity assessment procedures have not been applied to the device only in respect of a part or parts of the conformity assessment procedures to which one or more of those conformity assessment standards relate. Note: Conformity assessment standards are determined under Division 2 of"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "693b1de23cd9dc3f6bbd1467d101a2055fc005876d2cdd6979058cdf5abacdc4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "170"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exceptions for certain conformity assessment standards" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
