    cml:logicSummary "The condition of the inclusion of the medical device in the Register must be breached until the person commits an offence." ;
    cml:premiseText "The person commits an offence if a kind of medical device is included in the Register and does an act or omits to do an act." ;
    cml:conclusionText "The condition of the inclusion of the medical device in the Register must be breached until the person commits an offence." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::temporal_ltl" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41mn-ss-4a cml:asserts concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41mn-ss-4a-logic-deontic-5 .
