    values:originalText "(4) A person who contravenes subsection (3) commits a separate contravention of that subsection in respect of the manufacture, or the carrying out of the step in the manufacture, by the person of each unit of vaping goods.  Chapter 4A  Vaping goods" ;
    skos:definition "(4) A person who contravenes subsection (3) commits a separate contravention of that subsection in respect of the manufacture, or the carrying out of the step in the manufacture, by the person of each unit of vaping goods.  Chapter 4A  Vaping goods"@en ;
