doc:sec-41qb-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "41QB(4) Offences and civil penalty provision—supplying vaping goods" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) A person who contravenes subsection (3) commits a separate contravention of that subsection in respect of each unit of vaping goods supplied by the person in Australia. Note: For unit of vaping goods, see subsection 3(1). Exceptions—general" ;
    cof:pageNumber "206"^^xsd:integer .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41qb-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41QB(5) Offences and civil penalty provision—supplying vaping goods"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41qb-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Subsections (1) to (4) do not apply if: (a) subsections (6), (7) and (8) apply in relation to the supply of the vaping goods by the person; or (b) subsections (9), (10) and (11) apply in relation to the supply of the vaping goods by the person. Note: The person bears an evidential burden in relation to the matters in subsections (6), (7) and (8) or subsections (9), (10) and (11): see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code and section 41QE of this Act. Exceptions—wholesale supply chain" ;
    skos:definition "(5) Subsections (1) to (4) do not apply if: (a) subsections (6), (7) and (8) apply in relation to the supply of the vaping goods by the person; or (b) subsections (9), (10) and (11) apply in relation to the supply of the vaping goods by the person. Note: The person bears an evidential burden in relation to the matters in subsections (6), (7) and (8) or subsections (9), (10) and (11): see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code and section 41QE of this Act. Exceptions—wholesale supply chain"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e3d9db33033aa560475f4253fc1f2f427c00814af597579a826c1743b776c001" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41qb ;
    cof:pageNumber "206"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exemptions from subsections (1) to (4)" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
    dc:source "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.206" ;
