    values:originalText "(5) Subsections (1) to (4) do not apply if: (a) subsections (6), (7) and (8) apply in relation to the supply of the vaping goods by the person; or (b) subsections (9), (10) and (11) apply in relation to the supply of the vaping goods by the person. Note: The person bears an evidential burden in relation to the matters in subsections (6), (7) and (8) or subsections (9), (10) and (11): see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code and section 41QE of this Act. Exceptions—wholesale supply chain" ;
