concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41rb a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41RB Application to Secretary for consent to manufacture, supply"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41rb ;
    values:originalText "or possess vaping goods (1) A person may apply to the Secretary for consent to manufacture, supply or possess vaping goods. (2) An application under subsection (1) must be in accordance with a form approved by the Secretary and be accompanied by the fee (if any) prescribed by the regulations. Further information (3) The Secretary may, by notice in writing given to the applicant, require the applicant to give to the Secretary, within such reasonable time as is specified in the notice, such further information concerning the application as is specified in the notice. Applications or information may be given electronically (4) An approval of a form referred to in subsection (2), or a notice referred to in subsection (3), may require or permit an application or information to be given in accordance with specified software requirements: (a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or (b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission." ;
    skos:definition "or possess vaping goods (1) A person may apply to the Secretary for consent to manufacture, supply or possess vaping goods. (2) An application under subsection (1) must be in accordance with a form approved by the Secretary and be accompanied by the fee (if any) prescribed by the regulations. Further information (3) The Secretary may, by notice in writing given to the applicant, require the applicant to give to the Secretary, within such reasonable time as is specified in the notice, such further information concerning the application as is specified in the notice. Applications or information may be given electronically (4) An approval of a form referred to in subsection (2), or a notice referred to in subsection (3), may require or permit an application or information to be given in accordance with specified software requirements: (a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or (b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b869976e0d2ce9cee906734fba6320f6bb5c89de188e2a8fdbaae7f7aee121c1" ;
    cof:pageNumber "222"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41rb-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41rb-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41rb-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41rb-ss-4 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
