doc:sec-41rb-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "41RB(3) Application to Secretary for consent to manufacture, supply" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Secretary may, by notice in writing given to the applicant, require the applicant to give to the Secretary, within such reasonable time as is specified in the notice, such further information concerning the application as is specified in the notice. Applications or information may be given electronically" ;
    cof:pageNumber "222"^^xsd:integer .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41rb-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41RB(4) Application to Secretary for consent to manufacture, supply"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41rb-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) An approval of a form referred to in subsection (2), or a notice referred to in subsection (3), may require or permit an application or information to be given in accordance with specified software requirements: (a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or (b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission." ;
    skos:definition "(4) An approval of a form referred to in subsection (2), or a notice referred to in subsection (3), may require or permit an application or information to be given in accordance with specified software requirements: (a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or (b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission."@en ;
