    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2C) Without limiting subsection (2B), the decision-making principles may set out any of the following: (a) circumstances in which a consent under subsection (1) must not be given; (b) matters that must be taken into account in making a decision under subsection (1); (c) matters that must not be taken into account in making a decision under subsection (1); (d) matters that may be taken into account in making a decision under subsection (1)." ;
