concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41rc-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41RC(3) Secretary may give consent"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41rc-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Secretary must, as soon as practicable after making a decision to give a consent under subsection (1), cause particulars of the decision to be published on the Department’s website.  Chapter 4A  Vaping goods" ;
    skos:definition "(3) The Secretary must, as soon as practicable after making a decision to give a consent under subsection (1), cause particulars of the decision to be published on the Department’s website.  Chapter 4A  Vaping goods"@en ;
