    cof:title "42DD Restricted representations" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of this Part, a representation in an advertisement about therapeutic goods that refers to a form of a disease, condition, ailment or defect identified in a part of the Therapeutic Goods Advertising Code as a serious form of a disease, condition, ailment or defect is a restricted representation. Note: See sections 42DL and 42DLB for offences and a civil penalty for advertising therapeutic goods, where the advertisement contains a restricted representation.  Advertising, counterfeit therapeutic goods and product tampering  Chapter 5 Advertising and generic information  Part 5-1 General provisions about advertising therapeutic goods  Division 3 Section 42DE Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025" ;
    cof:pageNumber "230"^^xsd:integer .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42de a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "42DE Applications for approval of use of restricted representation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-42de ;
    values:originalText "(1) An application for approval of the use of a restricted representation must be made to the Secretary in accordance with a form approved, in writing, by the Secretary. (2) An approval of a form may require or permit an application to be given in accordance with specified software requirements: (a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or (b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission." ;
    skos:definition "(1) An application for approval of the use of a restricted representation must be made to the Secretary in accordance with a form approved, in writing, by the Secretary. (2) An approval of a form may require or permit an application to be given in accordance with specified software requirements: (a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or (b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2efa28eb90e130309cf250c25d74a5ad4d11fee9684de8f6c992bb3c3cdbb04f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "231"^^xsd:integer ;
