concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42dj a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "42DJ Prohibited and required representations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-42dj ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Part, representations of a kind specified in regulations made for the purposes of this subsection are prohibited representations about therapeutic goods of a kind specified in those regulations. (2) For the purposes of this Part, representations of a kind specified in regulations made for the purposes of this subsection are required representations about the therapeutic goods of a kind specified in those regulations.  Chapter 5  Advertising, counterfeit therapeutic goods and product tampering" ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Part, representations of a kind specified in regulations made for the purposes of this subsection are prohibited representations about therapeutic goods of a kind specified in those regulations. (2) For the purposes of this Part, representations of a kind specified in regulations made for the purposes of this subsection are required representations about the therapeutic goods of a kind specified in those regulations.  Chapter 5  Advertising, counterfeit therapeutic goods and product tampering"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9bf61adea8a6332d1820e45f703d3630d01c265fa0498c2cc7828e768d226b96" ;
