concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42dk-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "42DK(6) Permitted use of restricted or prohibited representations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-42dk-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) As soon as practicable after giving a permission under this section, the Secretary must cause the permission to be published on the Department’s website.  Advertising, counterfeit therapeutic goods and product tampering  Chapter 5 Advertising and generic information  Part 5-1 Advertising offences and civil penalties  Division 3A Section 42DKB Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025" ;
