concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42dr-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "42DR(4) Secretary may require information or documents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-42dr-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person is given a notice under section 42DR; and (b) the person gives information or produces a document in compliance or purported compliance with the notice; and (c) the information or document is false or misleading in a material particular. Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or both." ;
    skos:definition "(4) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person is given a notice under section 42DR; and (b) the person gives information or produces a document in compliance or purported compliance with the notice; and (c) the information or document is false or misleading in a material particular. Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or both."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "585509ff84961b491f51844c5f9d88e353b425505de68827dd9cf85377c9bef4" ;
