concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42ea a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "42EA Civil penalty relating to dealing with counterfeit therapeutic"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-42ea ;
    values:originalText "goods A person contravenes this section if: (a) the person does any of the following: (i) manufactures goods in Australia; (ii) supplies goods in Australia; (iii) imports goods into Australia; (iv) exports goods from Australia; and (b) the goods are therapeutic goods; and (c) the goods are counterfeit. Maximum civil penalty: (a) for an individual—5,000 penalty units; and (b) for a body corporate—50,000 penalty units." ;
    skos:definition "goods A person contravenes this section if: (a) the person does any of the following: (i) manufactures goods in Australia; (ii) supplies goods in Australia; (iii) imports goods into Australia; (iv) exports goods from Australia; and (b) the goods are therapeutic goods; and (c) the goods are counterfeit. Maximum civil penalty: (a) for an individual—5,000 penalty units; and (b) for a body corporate—50,000 penalty units."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "42a2297340de55f789ad2a3290d7c955bf4f90b5fd9fef4e81f135832377a6fe" ;
    cof:pageNumber "271"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Dealing with counterfeit therapeutic goods is prohibited." ;
