doc:sec-42v-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "42V(4) Recall of therapeutic goods because of actual or potential" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Secretary must cause to be published in the Gazette or on the Department’s website, as soon as practicable after imposing such requirements, a notice setting out particulars of the requirements.  Advertising, counterfeit therapeutic goods and product tampering  Chapter 5 Product tampering  Part 5-3  Section 42V Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025" ;
    cof:pageNumber "276"^^xsd:integer .

