doc:sec-42vb-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "42VB(3) Relief from liability for contraventions relating to the recall of" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) On an application under subsection (2), the Court may grant relief under subsection (1) as if proceedings had been begun in the Court.  Advertising, counterfeit therapeutic goods and product tampering  Chapter 5 Product tampering  Part 5-3  Section 42W Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025" ;
