concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-43 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "43 By whom charges payable"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-43 ;
    values:originalText "(1) An annual registration charge, annual listing charge or annual charge for inclusion in the Register is payable by the person in relation to whom the therapeutic goods concerned are registered, listed or included in the Register. (2) An annual licensing charge is payable by the holder of the licence to which the charge relates. (3) An annual conformity assessment body determination charge is payable by the Australian corporation that is the subject of the conformity assessment body determination to which the charge relates." ;
    skos:definition "(1) An annual registration charge, annual listing charge or annual charge for inclusion in the Register is payable by the person in relation to whom the therapeutic goods concerned are registered, listed or included in the Register. (2) An annual licensing charge is payable by the holder of the licence to which the charge relates. (3) An annual conformity assessment body determination charge is payable by the Australian corporation that is the subject of the conformity assessment body determination to which the charge relates."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4c6aca0c282367d3307ba6b2bc7883415f43c717ab308ac8ecccab957ae812ea" ;
    cof:pageNumber "301"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-43-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-43-ss-2 ;
