doc:sec-45ad-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "45AD(1) Offences and civil penalty for giving false or misleading" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person is given a notice under section 45AB; and (b) the person gives information, or produces a document, in compliance or purported compliance with the notice; and (c) the information or document is false or misleading in a material particular. Note: For the liability of an executive officer of a body corporate, see sections 54B and 54BA. Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or both. Strict liability offence" ;
    cof:pageNumber "309"^^xsd:integer .

