    skos:prefLabel "45AD(2) Offences and civil penalty for giving false or misleading"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-45ad-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A person commits an offence of strict liability if: (a) the person is given a notice under section 45AB; and  Chapter 6  Administration" ;
    skos:definition "(2) A person commits an offence of strict liability if: (a) the person is given a notice under section 45AB; and  Chapter 6  Administration"@en ;
