doc:sec-46-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "46(3) Searches to monitor compliance with Act or regulations" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) An authorised person is not entitled to exercise any powers under subsection (1) in relation to premises if: (a) the occupier of the premises has required the authorised person to produce his or her identity card for inspection by the occupier; and (b) the authorised person fails to comply with the requirement." ;
