    skos:definition "(2) An authorised person must not, under subsection (1), enter premises that are a residence unless: (a) the occupier of the premises has consented to the entry; or (b) the premises are used for commercial purposes in relation to therapeutic goods or vaping goods, in addition to residential purposes."@en ;
