concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-46a-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "46A(3) Searches of certain premises to monitor compliance with Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-46a-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) An authorised person is not entitled to exercise any powers under subsection (1) in relation to premises if: (a) the occupier of the premises has required the authorised person to produce his or her identity card for inspection by the occupier; and (b) the authorised person fails to comply with the requirement." ;
    skos:definition "(3) An authorised person is not entitled to exercise any powers under subsection (1) in relation to premises if: (a) the occupier of the premises has required the authorised person to produce his or her identity card for inspection by the occupier; and (b) the authorised person fails to comply with the requirement."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c6ed3c03f94ad096da34632b0ba7395dea3ec2bef71aacd3224baac3ce70db3f" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-46a ;
    cof:pageNumber "314"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Authorized person cannot exercise powers under subsection (1) if occupier requires identity card inspection." ;
