    skos:definition "(2) An authorised person is not entitled to exercise any powers under subsection (1) in relation to premises if: (a) the occupier of the premises has required the authorised person to produce his or her identity card for inspection by the occupier; and (b) the authorised person fails to comply with the requirement."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b93def83a19431a61d68cf2dfb4e1adeb4fd3c5337537f238ca4dec482d9591a" ;
