concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-48-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "48(4) General powers of authorised persons in relation to premises"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-48-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) It is a reasonable excuse for a person to refuse or fail to answer a question or produce a document if answering the question, or producing the document, would tend to incriminate the person.  Chapter 6  Administration" ;
