concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-48c-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "48C(5) Use of electronic equipment at premises relating to offences and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-48c-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The authorised person must give notice to the occupier of the premises of his or her intention to secure equipment and of the fact that the equipment may be secured for up to 24 hours.  Chapter 6  Administration" ;
    skos:definition "(5) The authorised person must give notice to the occupier of the premises of his or her intention to secure equipment and of the fact that the equipment may be secured for up to 24 hours.  Chapter 6  Administration"@en ;
