concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-51a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "51A Inspections for purposes of Mutual Recognition Convention"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-51a ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person may request the Secretary to arrange for an authorised person to inspect premises, and specified processes being carried out on those premises, for the purposes of paragraph 2 of Article 3 of the Mutual Recognition Convention.  Chapter 6  Administration" ;
