concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-52e-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "52E(3) Secretary to take certain matters into account in exercising"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-52e-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) In exercising a power under subsection 52D(2), the Secretary must have regard to any recommendations or advice of the Advisory Committee on Medicines Scheduling or the Advisory Committee on Chemicals Scheduling." ;
    skos:definition "(3) In exercising a power under subsection 52D(2), the Secretary must have regard to any recommendations or advice of the Advisory Committee on Medicines Scheduling or the Advisory Committee on Chemicals Scheduling."@en ;
