concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-52e-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "52E(4) Secretary to take certain matters into account in exercising"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-52e-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) In exercising a power under subsection 52D(2), the Secretary may seek advice from either or both of the following:  Administration  Chapter 6 Scheduling of substances  Part 6-3  Section 52EAA Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (a) any committee that the Secretary considers appropriate (whether or not the committee is established under this Act or the regulations); (b) any person." ;
    skos:definition "(4) In exercising a power under subsection 52D(2), the Secretary may seek advice from either or both of the following:  Administration  Chapter 6 Scheduling of substances  Part 6-3  Section 52EAA Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (a) any committee that the Secretary considers appropriate (whether or not the committee is established under this Act or the regulations); (b) any person."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d558cba65a58eac4c2e407c7279c75742bcacc9427869b7855d5f2d5d11a35d8" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-52e ;
    cof:pageNumber "344"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application may be required or permitted for specified software requirements Secretary may seek advice from committees or persons when exercising power." ;
