concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-52e-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "52E(3) Secretary to take certain matters into account in exercising"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-52e-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Secretary may, by notice in writing given to the person, require the person to give to the Secretary, within such reasonable time as is specified in the notice, such further information concerning the application as is specified in the notice. Applications or information may be given electronically" ;
    skos:definition "(3) The Secretary may, by notice in writing given to the person, require the person to give to the Secretary, within such reasonable time as is specified in the notice, such further information concerning the application as is specified in the notice. Applications or information may be given electronically"@en ;
