concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-52e-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "52E(4) Secretary to take certain matters into account in exercising"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-52e-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) An approval of a form mentioned in paragraph (2)(a), or a notice mentioned in subsection (3), may require or permit an application or information to be given in accordance with specified software requirements: (a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or (b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.  Chapter 6  Administration" ;
    skos:definition "(4) An approval of a form mentioned in paragraph (2)(a), or a notice mentioned in subsection (3), may require or permit an application or information to be given in accordance with specified software requirements: (a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or (b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.  Chapter 6  Administration"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6edb8f78a3eec2803d548bdc449346b35f8fdde4b3ed6a3d9ead06243ed77be6" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-52e ;
    cof:pageNumber "344"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application may be required or permitted for specified software requirements Secretary may seek advice from committees or persons when exercising power." ;
