concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-54b-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "54B(5) Personal liability of an executive officer of a body corporate—"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-54b-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) In this section: executive officer of a body corporate means a person, by whatever name called and whether or not a director of the body, who is concerned in, or takes part in, the management of the body." ;
    skos:definition "(5) In this section: executive officer of a body corporate means a person, by whatever name called and whether or not a director of the body, who is concerned in, or takes part in, the management of the body."@en ;
