concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-56 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56 Judicial notice"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-56 ;
    values:originalText "All courts (except in proceedings under Chapter 4) are to take judicial notice of the British Pharmacopoeia, the European Pharmacopoeia, the United States Pharmacopeia-National Formulary, a homoeopathic pharmacopoeia and an anthroposophic pharmacopoeia." ;
    skos:definition "All courts (except in proceedings under Chapter 4) are to take judicial notice of the British Pharmacopoeia, the European Pharmacopoeia, the United States Pharmacopeia-National Formulary, a homoeopathic pharmacopoeia and an anthroposophic pharmacopoeia."@en ;
