concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-57-ss-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "57(10) Delegation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-57-ss-10 ;
    values:originalText "(10) The power of the Minister under subsection 18A(1) or 41P(3) may be delegated only to: (a) the Secretary; or (b) an SES employee who holds, or performs the duties of, an SES Band 3 position in the Department; or (c) a person who is registered, in a State or internal Territory, as a medical practitioner and who holds, or performs the duties of, a position that is equivalent to, or higher than, an SES Band 2 position in the Department. (10AA) The power of the Minister under subsection 30EK(1) may be delegated only to: (a) the Secretary; or (b) an SES employee, or acting SES employee, in the Department; or (c) a person who is registered, in a State or internal Territory, as a medical practitioner and who holds, or performs the duties  Miscellaneous  Chapter 7  Section 58 Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 of, a position that is equivalent to, or higher than, an SES Band 2 position in the Department." ;
    skos:definition "(10) The power of the Minister under subsection 18A(1) or 41P(3) may be delegated only to: (a) the Secretary; or (b) an SES employee who holds, or performs the duties of, an SES Band 3 position in the Department; or (c) a person who is registered, in a State or internal Territory, as a medical practitioner and who holds, or performs the duties of, a position that is equivalent to, or higher than, an SES Band 2 position in the Department. (10AA) The power of the Minister under subsection 30EK(1) may be delegated only to: (a) the Secretary; or (b) an SES employee, or acting SES employee, in the Department; or (c) a person who is registered, in a State or internal Territory, as a medical practitioner and who holds, or performs the duties  Miscellaneous  Chapter 7  Section 58 Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 of, a position that is equivalent to, or higher than, an SES Band 2 position in the Department."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5e8c848fb79601b4574db4e64db39976664e9c7abf38011017dcd493fca99211" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-57 ;
    cof:pageNumber "364"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Delegation of power to certain individuals or positions within the Department." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf> ;
