doc:sec-57-ss-10a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "57(10A) Delegation" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(10A) The power of the Minister under subsection 32CB(1) may be delegated only to: (a) the Secretary; or (b) an SES employee who holds, or performs the duties of, an SES Band 3 position in the Department; or (c) a person who is registered, in a State or internal Territory, as a medical practitioner and who holds, or performs the duties of, a position that is equivalent to, or higher than, an SES Band 2 position in the Department." ;
    cof:pageNumber "364"^^xsd:integer .

