    skos:prefLabel "57(11) Delegation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-57-ss-11 ;
    values:originalText "(11) The power of the Minister under subsection 41GS(1) may be delegated only to: (a) the Secretary; or (b) an SES employee who holds, or performs the duties of, an SES Band 3 position in the Department; or (c) a person who is registered, in a State or internal Territory, as a medical practitioner and who holds, or performs the duties of, a position that is equivalent to, or higher than, an SES Band 2 position in the Department. Delegate must comply with directions" ;
    skos:definition "(11) The power of the Minister under subsection 41GS(1) may be delegated only to: (a) the Secretary; or (b) an SES employee who holds, or performs the duties of, an SES Band 3 position in the Department; or (c) a person who is registered, in a State or internal Territory, as a medical practitioner and who holds, or performs the duties of, a position that is equivalent to, or higher than, an SES Band 2 position in the Department. Delegate must comply with directions"@en ;
