concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-61-ss-4a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "61(4A) Release of information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-61-ss-4a ;
    values:originalText "(4A) The Secretary may release to: (a) an authority of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory that has functions relating to therapeutic goods, health or law enforcement; or (b) a national regulatory authority of another country that has national responsibility relating to therapeutic goods, health or law enforcement; or (ba) an international organisation that has a function relating to therapeutic goods, health or law enforcement; therapeutic goods information relating to one or more of the following: (c) notifications received under section 42T; (d) action taken by the Secretary under Part 5-3; (da) action taken by the Secretary under section 30EA (about notification and recall of therapeutic goods); (db) action taken by the Secretary under section 32HA (about notification and recall of biologicals); (dc) action taken by the Secretary under section 41KA (about notification and recall of medical devices); (e) contraventions, or possible contraventions, of Part 5-2 or" ;
    skos:definition "(4A) The Secretary may release to: (a) an authority of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory that has functions relating to therapeutic goods, health or law enforcement; or (b) a national regulatory authority of another country that has national responsibility relating to therapeutic goods, health or law enforcement; or (ba) an international organisation that has a function relating to therapeutic goods, health or law enforcement; therapeutic goods information relating to one or more of the following: (c) notifications received under section 42T; (d) action taken by the Secretary under Part 5-3; (da) action taken by the Secretary under section 30EA (about notification and recall of therapeutic goods); (db) action taken by the Secretary under section 32HA (about notification and recall of biologicals); (dc) action taken by the Secretary under section 41KA (about notification and recall of medical devices); (e) contraventions, or possible contraventions, of Part 5-2 or"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9ebfe4d8064ae8003d55d789fa7e104170b1a465ee272c077a9ad3026edbacf2" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-61 ;
    cof:pageNumber "377"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Release of information to authorities and international organisations" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
