doc:sec-63-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "63(5) Regulations" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) For the purposes of section 2, regulations may be made before the commencement of this Act as if this Act were in force, but do not come into effect on a day earlier than the day on which this Act commences.  Chapter 8  Repeal and transitional provisions  Section 66 Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 Chapter 8—Repeal and transitional provisions" ;
