doc:sec-66-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "66(4) Transitional arrangements for goods required to be registered or" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) A person who makes an application in accordance with subsection (3) is not required to pay: (a) any application fee for the registration or listing of the goods to which the application relates; or (b) in the case of an application for the registration of goods— any fee for the evaluation of the goods for registration; but where the goods are later evaluated to determine whether the goods should continue to be registered, such fee as is prescribed is payable in respect of that evaluation." ;
    cof:pageNumber "390"^^xsd:integer .

concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-4a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "66(4A) Transitional arrangements for goods required to be registered or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-66-ss-4a ;
    values:originalText "(4A) In relation to an evaluation conducted for the purposes of this section: (a) section 25 has effect as if: (i) the person in respect of whom the goods are registered were an applicant for the registration of the goods; and (ii) the reference in paragraph (1)(b) to an evaluation fee under section 24 were a reference to a fee payable under subsection (4) of this section; and (b) sections 24A, 24B and 24C have effect as if any reference in those sections to section 24 were a reference to subsection (4) of this section; and  Chapter 8  Repeal and transitional provisions  Section 67 Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (c) sections 24D and 24E do not apply." ;
    skos:definition "(4A) In relation to an evaluation conducted for the purposes of this section: (a) section 25 has effect as if: (i) the person in respect of whom the goods are registered were an applicant for the registration of the goods; and (ii) the reference in paragraph (1)(b) to an evaluation fee under section 24 were a reference to a fee payable under subsection (4) of this section; and (b) sections 24A, 24B and 24C have effect as if any reference in those sections to section 24 were a reference to subsection (4) of this section; and  Chapter 8  Repeal and transitional provisions  Section 67 Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 Compilation date: 05/09/2025 (c) sections 24D and 24E do not apply."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a83342b417c93b94a4679b8fcec0267e5d9a519f0d8822abfd5bc9ee8f79d95a" ;
    values:partOf concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66 ;
    cof:pageNumber "390"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Transitional arrangements for goods required to be registered or" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
